  },
  {
   "d": "2022-12-06",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "T he Group has had a strong start to FY23 with 10% revenue growth to date, whilst maintaining H2 gross profit margin and with lower marketing spend versus the comparative period last year",
   "file": "20221206_VIC_Full-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-02",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Victorian Plumbing continues to perform in line with the patterns of trade set out in the update provided alongside its Full Year results on 6 December 2022.",
   "file": "20230302_VIC_AGM-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-05-23",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We remain mindful that our customers still face a series of inflation related headwinds, however, with our resilient trading and market-leading proposition we remain confident in delivering expectations for the full year.",
   "file": "20230523_VIC_Half-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-05",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Profitability has improved year-on-year, driven by a product mix shift towards Victorian Plumbing own-brand ranges as well as by reduced shipping costs and favourable foreign exchange movements. Adjusted EBITDA for FY23 is anticipated to be in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20231005_VIC_Full-Year-Trading-Update.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-11-22",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Albeit early in the year and against a volatile consumer backdrop, the Group has had a positive start to the current year with revenue growth and gross profit margin progression versus the comparative period last year.",
   "file": "20231122_VIC_Full-Year-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-27",
   "doc": "AGM",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "The increase in own brand product sales continues to improve the Group's gross margin and, together with stable marketing spend efficiency, enables us to remain confident in delivering full year adjusted EBITDA in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20240227_VIC_AGM-Trading-Update-&-Notice-of-Results.md"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-05-28",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
